{"id":"H3458","lemma":"יִשְׁמָעֵאל","transliteration":"yishmael","sayIt":"yish-ma-EL","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ishmael","meaning":"A man of Arabia living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.16.11;\nson of: Abraham (H0085) and Hagar (H1904);\nhalf-brother of: Isaac (H3327), Zimran (H2175), Jokshan (H3370), Medan (H4091), Midian (H4080), Ishbak (H3435) and Shuah (H7744);\nfather of: Nebaioth (H5032), Kedar (H6938), Adbeel (H0110), Mibsam (H4017), Mishma (H4927), Dumah (H1746), Massa (H4854), Hadad (H2301), Tema (H8485), Jetur (H3195), Naphish (H5305), Kedemah (H6929) and Mahalath (H4258)\n§ Ishmael = \"God will hear\"\n1) son of Abraham and Sarah's handmaid Hagar and the progenitor of the Arabian peoples\n2) son of Nethaniah and the murderer of Gedaliah\n3) a Benjamite, one of the sons of Azel a descendant of Saul through Meribbaal or Mephibosheth\n4) a Judaite, father of Zebadiah\n5) a Judaite, son of Johanan and one of the captains who aided Jehoiada in restoring Joash to the throne\n6) a priest of the family of Pashur with a foreign wife whom he was forced to put away by Ezra","glosses":["ishmael","of","son","then ishmael","for","then kedar"],"count":44,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-16","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"for","kjv":"Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-16","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-16","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael","kjv":"Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-17","v":18,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael","kjv":"Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-17","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"As for Ishmael","kjv":"And as for Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-17","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael","kjv":"Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-17","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael","kjv":"And Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-17","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael","kjv":"and Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-25","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Ishmael","kjv":"and Ishmael"}},{"chapterId":"gen-25","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ishmael","kjv":"